window.products.push({"id":776059,"name":"Yourtablecloth Kitchen Gift Set-1 Kitchen Apron, an Oven Mitt & A Pot Holder-2 Kitchen Dish Towels or Tea Towels-Ideal Cooking Gifts or Gift Ideas for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1BqNpymePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a gift set that performs as incredibly as it appears, and offers good value for money? Are you looking for a thoughtful gift for your chef friend or a home cook who is so in love with cooking? Well, we have a fantastic solution to all your problems and you will love it for its many amazing features and benefits: Yourtablecloth Classy Kitchen Gift Set – 5 Pieces - A single package to meet an array of kitchen needs – contains an apron, a combo of oven mitt & pot holder, and a set of 2 kitchen towels - All made of 100% cotton for it offers ultra-high absorption, comfortable & elegant feel, ease of cleaning and high durability - Apron comes with an adjustable neck strap and waist ties to ensure that it can fit almost every body size; the 2 side pockets make it convenient to carry along essentials like cooking thermometer, tasting spoon, timer or other gadgets - Oven Mitt & Pot Holder Combo brings the best of both the designs together and lets you handle hot objects with more comfort and dexterity - 2 Kitchen towels which soak large quantities of water quickly, and make it easy to mop spills, dry plates, pots, pans, etc. – ideal for a number of other general purpose kitchen needs - Design & color coordinated set helps give a more professional look to any kitchen – be it a home kitchen, restaurant or a hotel - Highly durable design that is sure to last for way longer NOTE – It is recommended to use Cold Water for washing these accessories, preferably in a gentle cycle with tumble drying on low. It is also advisable not to bleach them or run them through a hot dryer! We also offer you 100% RISK-FREE SATISFACTION GUARANTEE! So, why think twice? ORDER NOW & Get this Incredible Kitchen Accessories Gift Set Delivered to you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1BqNpymePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yourtablecloth","source_asin":"B01N1SFLE2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N1SFLE2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N1SFLE2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":776060,"name":"Spun Bamboo Coasters for Drinks with Non-Skid Backing (Set of 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sV6sdZNdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Protect your tabletop with this handcrafted spun bamboo coaster set. Made from high quality organic bamboo, the unique design of these bamboo coasters will complement any tabletop for years to come. Skillfully Handmade Creating Earthly Spun Bamboo Coasters is an extremely labor intensive process that demands significant skill and dexterity. After soaking the bamboo in water for up to 4 months, the bamboo is then dried out, then soaked, and dried out again. The bamboo is then cut into strips and carefully coiled and press together by hand. The end result is more than just a coaster set, but a piece of art. Super Strong, Eco-Friendly Bamboo Did you know that bamboo grows at an incredible 3ft per day! Making it one of the most sustainable and eco-friendly resources earth has to offer. And since bamboo does not require pesticides or any agricultural chemicals at all, it is truly organic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sV6sdZNdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Earthly","source_asin":"B01MRTH2NJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRTH2NJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRTH2NJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
