window.products.push({"id":776081,"name":"Portable Air Conditioners Cooling Fan, Nekuya Evaporative Mini Air Conditioner with 3 Speeds, 7 Colors Light Personal Air Conditioner, 800ML Personal ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i0P-4VV2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Refreshing & Efficient Atomization] Nekuya portable air conditioner provides you with quick refreshment and comfort! It utilizes highly efficient and Energy-Saving technology, combined with a unique air duct design and a misting humidifier mouthpiece, which can lower the surrounding temperature by 46-55°F and deliver a powerful, cool, and refreshing air flow within 3 seconds, keeping you cool and preventing heat stroke. You can also add cold water or ice cubes at the top for even better cooling. Its compact and handheld design makes it perfect for use in room, kitchen, bedrooms, office and camping. [Flexible Use & Three Modes] With three fan speeds (natural wind/medium wind/high wind) and an adjustable 120° vertical air flow. Nekuya personal air conditioner provides various fan speed combinations for more options. We recommend adding ice cubes for a better experience. The USB-C power port allows it to be powered by laptop, adapter, mobile power, computer, and car charger. It comes with a USB-C charging cable, but the adapter is not included. It is compatible with a 5V 2A USB adapter. [2-4 Hour Timer & 7-Color Night Light] Cooling fan features 2 smart timer modes (2H/4H) that allow you to enjoy deep sleep or a nap, while helping you set appropriate sleep times to avoid prolonged exposure to cold air. Additionally, mini air conditioner comes with 7 automatic color-changing night lights and a room air conditioner suitable for use in a room/bedroom, creating a comfortable and relaxing sleep environment (light can be controlled via button). [800ML Large Water Tank & Long-lasting Cooling] Refusing to add water frequently, portable ac air conditioner is equipped with an 800ML sealed water tank, which can work for 8-10 hours after adding water and will start protection when the water runs out, so you don't need to worry when sleeping. The water level see-through window allows you to view and control the water level at any time. We cleverly designed the water tank at the bottom to increase the convenience of adding water and avoid leaks. [Quiet & 2023 Upgraded Structure] Unique 4 in 1 design not only serves as a cute air conditioner but also a usb desk fan, humidifier, and LED night light. Additionally, Nekuya air conditioner fan uses our improved misting technology, which reduces noise to below 45 decibels. 2023 Upgraded mesh structure makes the airflow more efficient, effectively lowering the surrounding temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i0P-4VV2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nekuya","source_asin":"B0C7CL5RFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7CL5RFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7CL5RFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
