window.products.push({"id":776281,"name":"忍者 Ninja BBQ Premium Stainless Steel Meat Claws, Grilling Accessories, Smoker Accessories, Meat Shredder with Safe Soft Grip Material- Meat Holding, M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318TYsdOZpL._AC_.jpg","description":"✔ Hello Customers, We aim to provide the highest quality product for customer satisfaction. How about having a good BBQ time with family, friends, and colleagues with our Meat Claws? Our product will make your BBQ party even more enjoyable and fun. The Meat claws supports you to cut and shred pork, beef, chicken, etc. with less effort. Not only for cutting and shredding meat, it can also be used to hold some foods, mix vegetables and in various ways. Our Meat Claws features are durability and convenience. The Stainless steel is strong and it’s incomparable with plastic products. It is made of Stainless Steel 304 which is an excellent corrosion resistance. You don't need worry about ruining your food because of the high temperature. The material is soft and makes it easy to grip even when they’re wet. It doesn’t slip and slide with plenty of room for your knuckles to grip for a solid grip which makes shredding chicken, pork, turkey, and brisket real easy without feeling tight and uncomfortable. It is made of high quality material ABS+TPR, non-toxic. Cleaning the meat claws is safe to use dishwasher. You can save your valuable time more efficiently. ✔ ✔Once again to emphasize our meat claws. Good Quality Good Quality Multifunction Multifunction Efficient Efficient ✔ Specifications All Black Handle Metal Claw All Black Handle Metal Claw Materials: ABS + TPR + Stainless Steel 304 Materials: ABS + TPR + Stainless Steel 304 Product Weight: 430g / pair Product Weight: 430g / pair Product Size: 11.5 * 12cm Product Size: 11.5 * 12cm Package Includes: 2 claw shredders / 1 pair Package Includes: 2 claw shredders / 1 pair Thank you for taking time. BBQ Ninja always to satis","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318TYsdOZpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"忍者 Ninja BBQ","source_asin":"B07PQXXQK9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PQXXQK9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PQXXQK9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
