window.products.push({"id":776295,"name":"Ergonomic Office Chair - Ergousit Mesh Desk Chair with Adjustable Backrest and Flip up Armrest, Rolling Office Chair with Headrest, Lumbar Support, Ex","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EvtI7EpVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ergonomic Office Chair】The ergonomic office chair provides 4 supporting points(head/ back/ hips/ hands) and a proper lumbar support. The desk Chair with adjustable seat, headrest, backrest and flip-up arms accommodate almost any body type comfortably. Suitable for people of about 5'5\" to 6'3\". the backrest with good adjust-ability for helping your find ideal position for long time sitting,which is used to reduce pressure and pain to your back. 【Lumbar Support Alleviate Back Pain】The mesh back of office chair is ergonomically designed to ensure the curve design fit your back and waist,The desk chairs have excellent functional lumbar support,to provide the best support for all types of people,fits body curved backrest with lumbar support will help you improve your posture, especially the chair backrest can adjust your sitting posture to maintain a healthy work status. 【Comfortable Breathable Mesh backrest】Compared to other regular work chairs,our technical mesh task chairs are designed by keeping in mind the habits, personality, traits, line of work,Mesh back designing ensure air circulate well to avoids accumulation of heat and eliminating moisture build up to keep your whole body comfortable and cool,keep your back sweat-free. ▶【Thickened Seat Pad &Flip up Armrest】The Ergonomic chair padded mesh seat is thick and resilient,made of high grade thick sponge and breathable mesh clothes, prevent body heat and keep your hip and legs sweat-free,The erogonomic chair comes with a 70° Flip-up armrest which can be adjusted, provide comfortable arm support for various sitting positions to meet various needs, flip up the armrest save more space. 【Easy to Assemble & Passed BIFMA Support 300Ibs 】Ergousit office chair has a five-point strong base, which tested to hold a heavy-duty up to 300 lbs;the gas lift cylinder has Passed SGS & BIFMA X5.1-2, strong bearing capacity.360 degrees casters easily glide over all types of surfaces that provide smooth motions for maneuvering around your desk; Additionally, we provide the detailed instruction to help you quick and hassle-free to install the office chair. 【Put Less Amount Of Pressure On Hip And Buttocks】Sitting on regular chair leads to tremendous amount of pressure on the hip and buttocks. These issues can be reduced by using ergonomic chairs as they are made of soft material, which puts less amount of pressure on these areas. The elasticity fits the contour of the buttocks more comfortably. 【5-year Technical Support, No After-sales Worry】We promise our customers 100% satisfaction with our premium desk chair! If you’re not satisfied with this executive chair, just contact us and get a replacement,our after-sale policy can be make you buy with confidence","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EvtI7EpVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ergousit","source_asin":"B08N4T6D6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N4T6D6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N4T6D6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
