window.products.push({"id":776438,"name":"Household Essentials Woven Seagrass Side-by-Side Magazine Rack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YO-EaqKiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Household Essentials Sea grass side by side magazine rack has an interior divider that creates two compartments to hold all of your favorite magazines. The rack features a sturdily woven contemporary design and a built-in handle for easy carrying. The Sea grass side by side magazine rack will enhance your decor either all on its own or when grouped with other Sea grass items from Household Essentials. Keep all of your magazines crinkle-free and off your countertops with this sea grass side by side magazine rack. The rack features tall walls to keep all of your favorite print publications from flopping out of place and onto your floor. The divider with built-in handle in the middle creates two compartments! No more intermingling of family member magazines. Choose one side just for your own. The woven sea grass design is a beautiful pattern that can go in any area where magazines stack up - and eventually fall over. The wide bottom and sturdy side walls keep your magazines contained to free up your valuable table and counter spaces. This rack also works well in offices to round up catalogs, manuals, files and memos and keep your work space free of clutter. A perfect fit for any space, this rack is a gorgeous and functional addition to your living room, bedroom, or bathroom - or just about anywhere you open mail, read, or work. The quality construction gives the sea grass side by side magazine rack extra stability to stand up to even your bulkiest print manuals for fast, simple and attractive storage. Add a rack to every room of your home or office and clear your crowded workspace, table tops and shelving for other uses. At Household Essentials, we help you organize your home or office with sturdiness, style and functionality. The Sea grass side by side magazine rack will keep your paperwork arranged and in place to open up your space and time for other things. Enjoy, from our Household to yours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YO-EaqKiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B0BXHM1FKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXHM1FKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXHM1FKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
