window.products.push({"id":776505,"name":"40pcs Gold Table Number Holders, 3.3 Inch Place Card Holder Cute Table Card Holders for Picture Photo, Food Signs Memo Name Note Table Number Stands I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SloCVZdgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Elegant Appearance] The two circular rings of the table number holders are classic and elegant, which can be incorporated into a wedding theme. The color of gold is noble yet elegant, perfectly matches any decor style and can not only add festive atmosphere but also create a romantic and unique sense of fashion. These table number stands look small and cute, putting it on the desktop with beautiful cards and flowers will add a sense of luxury to your table and impress your guests. [Perfect Design] The wide spiral base of 1.57 inch diameter is sturdy enough that it can keep the place card holder steady and keep the clamped card upright and stable. It's suitable for indoor and outdoor, and will not tip over even though in breezy circumstance. The two circles clips at the top of the picture holder can hold your name card or table number firmly without falling down. The size is perfect to display the card's content clearly and it is suitable to hold standard-sized card. [Sturdy and Durable] Our table card holders are made of premium steel wire, which is sturdy, durable and can be reused over and over. The surface of this photo holder is plated so that it looks smooth and shiny. What's more, these gold table number holders won't break or fade because of its high quality material. When party is over, you can keep them well and reuse them next time. [Multi-Function/Occasion] The elegant table number holder has many functions which brings lots of convenience to your life. It can be used as wedding name card for table setting, banquet table number clip, table menu rack, etc, helping guests navigate to their respective tables or related items easily; as well as used to write down unexpected office tasks, making the messy table top to be in order. This photo holder suits for wedding, anniversaries, birthday party, restaurant, home and office. [Packing List and After-Sale] The package comes with 40 pcs 3.3 inch tall place card holders and 20 pcs nanometre circle pasters, which are complimentary to be a gift. When you use these table card holders outdoor in breezy days, you can attache the nanometre pasters to the holder's bases to make them stand more steadily on the table. If you have any problem, please don't hesitate to contact us, we'll solve the problem for you as soon as possible. Your satisfaction is our only pursuit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SloCVZdgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"cyrico","source_asin":"B09SLRSF99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SLRSF99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SLRSF99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":776506,"name":"Ovente Electric Stainless Steel Hot Water Kettle 1.7 Liter with 5 Temperature Control & Concealed Heating Element, BPA-Free 1100 Watt Tea Maker with A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jcvfzk4wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ovente KS88 Series are stainless steel electric kettles that flatter any kitchen countertop. It’s available in 3 different colors: brushed (silver), dark cherry red, and chocolate brown. This kettle has a keep-warm function that holds temperature for up to 2 hours, and an LED light that changes colors (green, blue, yellow, purple, red) based on the chosen temperature setting. Electronic Temperature Control enables you to set the temperature by pressing the “+/-“ button to suit your needs. It also comes with a 2-YEAR WARRANTY, so rest assured, Ovente has your back. With its 1.7L capacity and 1100-Watts of power, it is proven to be 50% more efficient than stovetop kettles in reducing your daily electricity use. The kettle has a stainless steel concealed water heating element to prevent extra mineral build-up, a flip-back lid for convenient filling, and a removable/washable filter to ensure the purest results. For safety purposes, this kettle is equipped with auto shut-off, boil-dry protection, secure locking lid, LED indicator light, cool-touch button and a comfortable stay-cool handle. Instructions for use: 1. Fill with water up to desired amount 2. Push the steam switch button down. 3. This kettle will boil water in less than 7 minutes (at maximum level), and hot water will be ready to use for instant coffee, tea, hot cereal, instant macaroni or oatmeal, etc. **Before first use, fill kettle to MAX (1.7L), bring to a full boil, and wait until the indicator light turns off before using.** Specifications: -Capacity: 1.7 Liters -Stainless Steel Concealed Heating Element -Materials: BPA-Free Plastic (Water Gauge, Inner Lid), High-Grade Stainless Steel For all the benefits of this kettle WITHOUT the beep, check out our other similar model, Ovente KS89 Series Stainless Steel Electric Kettle, also sold on Amazon. Note: Electric kettles may reach boiling faster at higher altitudes due to the fluctuation of boiling points.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jcvfzk4wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OVENTE","source_asin":"B07K46H271","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K46H271","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K46H271","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
