window.products.push({"id":776718,"name":"UCFOAM UC-991 Foam Wash Gun 3000 PSI High Pressure Washer Jet Snow Foam Lance Foam Cannon Foam Blaster with M22-14mm Thread","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Td6xV8JDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Material:brass+ABSInterface: G1 / 4 \"-FMax Pressure: 200BAR - 3000PSI Rated pressure:70BAR - 1000PSI Maximum Pressure: 200 Bar -3000PSI Maximum flow: 5.3GPM Max Temperature: 60℃ / 140℉ Bottle Capacity: 1L Description: Used to clean your items by jetting foam.Simple operation, just need a washing machine , you will have a professional machine foam jet effect . Some tips for using the foam gun correctly : - Fill the bottle with hot/warm water before adding soap. This helps your solution mix together. - Adjust the spray nozzle first to find the stream of water that works for you. You can adjust it so that it sprays in a decent fan pattern. - Adjust the knob on the top to control how much water is mixed in. The minus (-) sign indicates less water (so more foam is produced), and the (+) indicates more water (so less foam is produced). DO NOT max out the knob onto the (-) side otherwise you wont get much foam. You can turn it all the way to the (-) then dial it back a little, this produced a ton of foam. Package Included: 1 X Pressure Washer Gun 1 X Snow Foam Bottle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Td6xV8JDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UCFOAM","source_asin":"B078HRDQN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078HRDQN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078HRDQN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
