window.products.push({"id":776765,"name":"Seville Classics Bamboo Board with 5 Removable Cutting Mats","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41i7oqw3rKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Let your inner chef come alive with Seville Classics' Two-Tone Bamboo Cutting Board with Juice Well and 5 Color-Coded Flexible Cutting Mats. Bamboo is a renewable, fast-growing, and hardy material that is stronger, more sustainable and easier on knives than hardwood cutting boards and chopping blocks. This board features a unique rounded rectangle design with layered bamboo and contrasting juice well. A ventilated compartment for cutting board mats allow them to be stored inside the cutting board. The handle grooves are easy to grab even when placed on flat surfaces. Includes five flexible polypropylene color-coded mats designed to fit snugly into the top surface of the cutting board. Use them as a cutting surface, as a tray to transport food, or bend them into a funnel for plating chopped ingredients. Bamboo cutting board is NOT dishwasher safe, but the cutting mats are dishwasher safe (do not exceed a wash or drying temperature of 170° F.) Cleaning the bamboo cutting board is easy--wash with warm water and mild detergent and air dry. Wipe the board down with food-safe mineral oil regularly to keep it sanitary and supple. Patents: US Pat. #7,758,029 Rounded rectangle natural bamboo cutting board with ventilated storage compartment Includes 5 color-coded cutting board mats designed to fit in the top surface of the cutting board; colors include green, white, yellow, red and blue 100% polypropylene cutting mats; dishwasher safe (do not exceed wash or drying temp of 170° F) Cutting board features contrasting grooved juice well for easy clean-up of juice and meat drippings Four non-slip silicone feet prevent sliding and without scratching your kitchen countertop Specifications Dimensions: 16.5\" L x 13.4\" W x 1.25\" thick Weight: 4 lbs. Model #: WEB297 What's in the Box? 1 bamboo cutting board (16.5\" x 13.4\" x 1.25\" thick) 5 color-coded cutting mats (15.5\" x 12.5\" x .03\" thick) Limited 1-Year Manufacturer's Warranty Seville Classics products are backed by a 1-year limited warranty unless otherwise specified. The warranty protects against original defects in material or workmanship under normal home or office use for the duration of the warranty period.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41i7oqw3rKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seville Classics","source_asin":"B01GSH5LNY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GSH5LNY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GSH5LNY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
