window.products.push({"id":776894,"name":"100 Mylar Bags For Food Storage - 10 mil 1 Gallon (25pc), 8 mil 1 Quart (35pc, 6 mil 1/2 Pint (40pc, Stand Up Resealable Mylar Bags With Oxygen Absorb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I1PSmXEUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[MYLAR BAGS FOR FOOD STORAGE] Food is not made to waste. Large Mylar bags with oxygen absorbers will store your food properly. Mylar bag is made of 3 layers of food grade materials: PET, aluminum foil, and PE. Resealable mylar bags are durable and heavy duty. Three sizes: Gallon, Quarter, 7 oz. Milar bags protects your food against oxygen, moisture and sunlight to ensure longer food storage life. [PACKAGE INCLUDES] 25 pcs 10 mil 1 Gallon mylar bags, 10\"x14\"; 35 pcs 8 mil 1 Quart myler bags, 6\"x9\"; 40 pcs 6 mil small mylar bags 4\"x6\". Bigger size needs thicker material. Mylar ziplock bags come with 100 300CC oxygen absorbers and 120 labels. 5 Oxygen absorbers were vacuum-sealed immediately after production. 5 per bag x 20 bags. Unused one will still be as effective as new for years. [MYLAR VACUUM SEAL BAGS] You can seal zipper for short term storage. For long term storage, seal the top section above the zipper with vacuum sealer, hair straightener, steam iron. Our 7 mil mylar bags for food storage comes with standup design, making it much easier to fill, organize and storage. These vacuum seal mylar bags mylar food bags can be used with temperature 0°F-183°F. [MULTIPURPOSE USE] Mylar bags 1 gallon 1 Quart and Small are perfect for packaging or storing: dehydrated food, freeze dried products, grains, rice, beans, candies, oats, spice, nuts, cookies, tea, dried fruit, coffee beans, chips, cereal, rice, pasta, jewelry, make-up & lip gloss, wax melt, dog treat, soaps & bath salt etc. You can take the mylar food storage bags to a picnic, BBQ, camping, etc. The thickness listed is the thickness of the bag, not that of one layer (which is 5, 4, 3 mil respectively). Mylar bags for food storage with oxygen absorbers are suitable for packing, storing, shipping, sampling, and sorting. 1 gallon mylar bags with oxygen absorbers 1 gallon mylar bags for food storage mylar storage bags for food gallon mylar bags and oxygen absorbers mylar food storage bags with oxygen absorbers bolsas mylar para guardar alimentos Air is about 20 percent oxygen and 80 percent nitrogen. Oxygen Absorbers remove only the oxygen, NOT THE AIR. The air left in the container is mostly nitrogen and will not affect the food or allow the growth of insects. Therefore, the final packaging may not have the appearance of being \"vacuum-packed\" because of the remaining nitrogen in the package. The only way to get a good vacuum seal inside the bag is to use a vacuum sealer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I1PSmXEUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMERICAN HAWKS","source_asin":"B0BNP47JPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNP47JPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNP47JPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
