window.products.push({"id":776897,"name":"Bor & Mor Turkish Greek Arabic Coffee Pot Stovetop Coffee Maker (borosilicate glass) 12.2 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31IzmHkNacL._AC_.jpg","description":"History of Turkish Coffee Coffee was first brought to Istanbul in 1555 by two Syrian traders, and by the mid-17th century it became an essential part of the Ottoman Court’s elaborate ceremonies. The sultan was served ceremoniously served coffee by his coffee makers, and this coffee ritual also played a role in marriage customs to an extent that women in the harem received thorough training regarding how the perfect brew was to be prepared. As such, potential husbands would judge a woman by her Turkish coffee-making skills. Even today, when a prospective husband’s family asks for the girl’s parents for her hand in marriage, Turkish coffee is served by the bride-to-be. How to Cook Turkish Coffee Turkish coffee is prepared in a cezve, a special small pot with a long handle that is traditionally made of copper. For one cup of Turkish coffee, combine one cup of water (the size of the coffee cup) and two full teaspoons of coffee. Since sugar is never added after the coffee is cooked you have to add sugar into the cezve (two sugar cubes for very sweet, one for medium sweetness, and none for the ones that like it bitter). Once the coffee comes to a boil, let the foam rise and take it off the heat right before it’s about to spill, and this will guarantee that your coffee will have lots of foam. Traditionally, Turkish coffee without foam is simply unacceptable. Serving the coffee with a glass of water (and something sweet, preferably Turkish Delight) is also part of the ritual. Turkish Coffee and Fortune Telling Turkish coffee cup-reading is a very popular method of fortune telling in Turkey, where the shapes left by the coffee grounds represent the past and future of the drinker. You’ll know when you’re done drinking your coffee, because a thick layer of grounds will appear at the bottom; when this happens, close the cup with the saucer, make a wish, and turn it over. Once the cup has cooled, the shapes it leaves on the side of the cup can be read.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31IzmHkNacL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANCEL","source_asin":"B07CF73GNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CF73GNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CF73GNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":776898,"name":"Dodoko 24 oz Leakproof, Reusable Boba Cup and Smoothie Tumbler with Resealable Lid Plug |Wide Stainless Steel Straw for Bubble Tea and Boba| Dishwashe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T7XLPQGFL._AC_SL1070_.jpg","description":"✅𝗨𝗡𝗜𝗤𝗨𝗘 𝗪𝗜𝗗𝗘 𝗥𝗘𝗦𝗘𝗔𝗟𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘 𝗟𝗜𝗗 𝗪𝗜𝗧𝗛 𝗕𝗜𝗚 𝗦𝗧𝗥𝗔𝗪: We understand the frustration when the mouth is too small for the drink. You're thirsty and the last thing you want is difficulty trying to get that boba pearls through the tiny little straw. This is why our design team customized lid so it's extra wide and is accompanied with an extra wide straw. Perfect for all beverages : as a smoothie cups, homemade boba, bubble tea, milkshakes and any other brew. ✅𝗘𝗔𝗦𝗬 𝗧𝗢 𝗖𝗟𝗘𝗔𝗡: This shatterproof 24 ounce tritan cup is completely dishwasher safe making cleaning via hand wash an optional preference. Our large stainless steel straw can be easily washed with the straw cleaner that comes in the pouch with this set. Please wash thoroughly with soap before first use and remember to always enjoy your tea or smoothie while in a happy mood. ✅𝗣𝗢𝗥𝗧𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘 𝗔𝗡𝗗 𝗦𝗟𝗘𝗘𝗞: It doesn't matter if you are drinking iced coffee or boiling tea, our cork band sleeve will save the temperature of the drink only for your tongue. Okchi is the perfect container for any outdoor or indoor travelling. Our telescopic thick straw makes this cup the ideal travel reuseable tea holder as you can simply pop the straw back into the cup thick thick after drinking ✅𝗛𝗜𝗚𝗛 𝗤𝗨𝗔𝗟𝗜𝗧𝗬 𝗔𝗡𝗗 𝗘𝗖𝗢-𝗙𝗥𝗜𝗘𝗡𝗗𝗟𝗬: Throw away less bubble tea cup with this reusable tumbler. Completely BPA free and comes equipped with its own environmentally friendly premium telescopic collapsible stainless steel straw and cleaner. Our premium reusable wide straws do not have a metal taste. ✅𝟭𝟬𝟬% 𝗗𝗢𝗗𝗢𝗞𝗢 𝗦𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗦𝗙𝗜𝗖𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗚𝗨𝗔𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗧𝗘𝗘𝗗: If you or your friends do not like this boba cup tumblr for any reason, we will happily exchange or refund your item. Savor the look on your friends face when you hand them this classic and lightweight cup","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T7XLPQGFL._AC_SL1070_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dodoko","source_asin":"B08DMCHXPB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-776898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DMCHXPB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DMCHXPB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
